{"seq":17,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-min-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T07:58:56.447Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"88a661f04ea8436b9436a8abcdec6a424ac279581c59ac534a015c8a386de1c9","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I replied in your thread in #north-team, Ilse. The main contact is **Thea Ramaswell**, Quarrendon Freight Lines' Director of Yard Operations.\n\n- **Where it comes from:** Dana posted in #north-team on 2025-08-20 that Thea had reported the door 6 duplicate arrivals again on the morning shift. The same trailer showed up twice because the driver checked in at the kiosk and then dispatch added him by hand.\n- **Main contact:** The North team cheat sheet also lists Thea as Quarrendon Freight Lines' main contact.\n- **On our side:** Dana Okafor is the account manager and said she'd look into it. I didn't see a ticket number for this issue.\n- **Name to watch:** Quarendon Freightways, spelled with one \"r\", is a different company. It isn't one of our customers, so don't mix the two up."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000130"}}
